# FRONTEND build-time variables (Vite).
#
# The app needs NONE: it calls its own domain (/api/...), so there is no API URL
# to configure.
#
# RULE: anything named VITE_* is copied into the public JavaScript that every
# visitor downloads. Never put a secret, key, password or database URL here.
# Only non-secret display settings belong in this file, for example:
#
# VITE_SITE_NAME=MyCTF
